{"id":"67be5c48288e58ea","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-model-continuous-chain.md","title":"ZFC Model Continuous Chain","display":"df-zfc-model-continuous-chain — ZFC Model Continuous Chain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-continuous-chain","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-continuous-chain"],"display":"df-zfc-model-continuous-chain — ZFC Model Continuous Chain","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-elementary-chain.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-continuous-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-continuous-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-continuous-chain — ZFC Model Continuous Chain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e2db788b9ba8ebdc\" href=\"?note=e2db788b9ba8ebdc\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-elementary-chain.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-elementary-chain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,\\delta,\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(C,\\delta,\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S\\)</span> is the four-place predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2db788b9ba8ebdc\" href=\"?note=e2db788b9ba8ebdc\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-elementary-chain.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-elementary-chain.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelContinuousChain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelContinuousChain}_S\\)</span> is the three-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelContinuousChain}_S(C,\\delta,\\mathcal L) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(C)=\\delta\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S(C,\\delta,\\in,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\;\\left(\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)\\to C(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\lambda}C(i)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelContinuousChain}_S(C,\\delta,\\mathcal L) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(C)=\\delta\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S(C,\\delta,\\in,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\;\\left(\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)\\to C(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\lambda}C(i)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>连续性是加在序数指标初等链上的条件，而不只是一个对任意序列都可能偶然成立的极限等式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]